<title>USA: U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CST - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CST - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boxed beef weak on mostly moderate demand and moderate to heavy offerings. Select and Choice rib, round and loin cuts weak, while the chuck cuts steady to weak. Beef trimmings not established. - USDA</p>
